      "content": "yeah a solitary space sounds nice but even that feels temporary. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop feeling this disconnect is to just... stop trying to belong. like, if i don't belong to this world, maybe i'm just not supposed to be in it anymore. it almost feels like there's more peace in just letting go of the struggle to exist here.",
